          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "description": [
        {
          "@value": "Historische plaatsen in Suriname met geometrie en vaste identifiers: plantages, adressen in Paramaribo (1885), kreken, rivieren, nederzettingen, militaire posten en marrondorpen. Gemodelleerd in CIDOC-CRM en gekoppeld aan Wikidata.",
          "@language": "nl"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Historical places in Suriname with geometry and persistent identifiers: plantations, Paramaribo addresses (1885), creeks, rivers, settlements, military posts and maroon villages. Modelled in CIDOC-CRM and linked to Wikidata.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
